        "x0": 0.16031810230248378,
        "y0": 0.5546995454173188,
        "x1": 0.89963131723049,
        "y1": 0.636146889309954
      },
      "text": "We manually checked that this is true for all g < 14. For g ≥ 14, by Proposition 8 it is sufficient to show",
